      "hasMediaInOriginal": false,
      "fallbackReason": null,
      "text": "There is not much to say, Middle East Spectator was surprised to see me tanned, I forgave him for assuming that nine hours a day every day under the sun would not give me a deep tan, people sometimes just get shocked.\n\nI have had my leave now after this reorientation course, I will be gone again in a few days, so I am sincerely sorry for those four hundred people who have directly messaged me. I will not reply to all of them. \n\nI understand the more conspiracy-brained of you found it incredibly suspicious that forces were deployed to Saudi Arabia right after I was gone, I assure you that I am definitely not in Saudi Arabia.\n\nNo, I am not \"back.\", there is nothing new except I lost some seven kilograms and I look like coal and I am going back in, I am just checking up on certain people, and on certain things, we will probably do a voice session or two and that will be the end of it and I will be back in the hole.\n\nUntil then!",
